what a person like me goes
through on a daily basis

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.340
or give a fuck really, honestly.

00:14:50.845 --> 00:14:52.946
I go to the store I see
people that have a life,

00:14:52.946 --> 00:14:54.728
they have somewhere to
go, have somewhere to be.

00:14:54.728 --> 00:14:57.177
They look at me with disgust

00:14:57.177 --> 00:14:58.350
and I just think to myself like,

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:00.109
"Damn, I wonder how they would look at me

00:15:00.109 --> 00:15:03.276
"if they knew what I've been through."

00:15:17.955 --> 00:15:19.540
And the only reason I'm
doing this because I hope

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.607
that maybe somebody who
gives a fuck will listen.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:27.360
And somebody who gives a
fuck would try and help.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.600
That's what I'm hoping for.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.993
- [Mark] Kristina, thank you
so much for talking with me.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:44.610
- Don't even trip.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:46.873
Gotcha.

